<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Glencore cuts Anaconda stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Glencore cuts Anaconda stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss commodities trader Glencore International AG said on Wednesday it had cut its stake in nickel mine developer Anaconda Nickel NL to 14.53 percent from 17.14 percent.</p>
<p>Glencore said in a substantial shareholder notice to the Australian Stock Exchange it had sold three million shares for A$9.9 million on October 4, reducing its stake to 105.49 million shares.</p>
<p>Anaconda's share price was three cents firmer at A$3.33 at 12.50 pm (0250 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
